<p class="sub-band" style="margin-top:0">AI powered smart agriculture platform</p>
<p>An autonomous agriculture drone with an ESP32 for flight control and a Raspberry Pi 4 running real time NDVI crop health monitoring, paired with edge deployed language model guidance for irrigation scheduling and disease detection. Yield prediction accuracy improved by 24%, manual inspection time halved, water use dropped by 30%, and latency fell by 40%.</p>
        <p>A companion project fine tuned LLaVA on a custom leaf disease image and text dataset, reaching 90% accuracy on multi class detection, behind a chatbot that resolved about 75% of routine farmer queries without a human in the loop.</p>
